{"id":"n68472-2-7","stage":5,"title":"완만하다 · 缓","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68472-2-7-1","ko":"민준 씨, 제품 만족도 설문 결과는 다 정리됐어요?","zh":"敏俊先生，产品满意度调查的结果都整理好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊。","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"제품","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}},{"text":"만족도","meaning":"满意度","explanation":"만족도：满意度。","readings":[{"term":"만족도","audio":"/audio/1a0f2d1a9b43bf70113a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52984","senseId":"1","lemma":"만족도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만족도","audio":"/audio/1a0f2d1a9b43bf70113a.mp3"}},{"text":"설문","meaning":"提问，问卷","explanation":"설문：提问，问卷。","readings":[{"term":"설문","audio":"/audio/3acbe7fce46351d02dc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45003","senseId":"1","lemma":"설문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설문","audio":"/audio/3acbe7fce46351d02dc9.mp3"}},{"text":"결과는","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결과는","audio":"/audio/28337c6c8efe9b3439eb.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"정리됐어요?","meaning":"被整理","explanation":"정리되다：被整理；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정리되다","audio":"/audio/7e159f1e42ed8167791f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31745","senseId":"2","lemma":"정리되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정리됐어요","audio":"/audio/9d0a294ef019956beb9c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"60be380dfd52bdfe","term":"제품","zh":"产品，制品","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3","entryId":"70898","definition":"使用材料制作物品；或指经此做出来的物品。","pronunciation":["제ː품"]},{"id":"1a0f2d1a9b43bf70","term":"만족도","zh":"满意度","audio":"/audio/1a0f2d1a9b43bf70113a.mp3","entryId":"52984","definition":"某种期待或需要得到实现的感受程度。","pronunciation":["만족또"]},{"id":"3acbe7fce46351d0","term":"설문","zh":"提问，问卷","audio":"/audio/3acbe7fce46351d02dc9.mp3","entryId":"45003","definition":"为调查某事实而向多个人问问题；或指该问题。","pronunciation":["설문"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"7e159f1e42ed8167","term":"정리되다","zh":"被整理","audio":"/audio/7e159f1e42ed8167791f.mp3","entryId":"31745","definition":"按照种类被有系统地分类或合并。","pronunciation":["정ː니되다","정ː니뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73e7334f1c2c1f40ee77.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68472-2-7-2","ko":"네, 그래프로 그려보니까 기능의 추가 여부에 따라 만족도가 완만하게 곡선을 그리면서 증가하더라고요.","zh":"是的，用图表展示后可以发现，根据是否添加新功能，满意度会呈平缓的曲线逐渐上升。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그래프로","meaning":"图表，图解，示意图","explanation":"그래프：图表，图解，示意图；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"그래프","audio":"/audio/4694ee91180b2a45eb37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36266","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래프","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래프로","audio":"/audio/f616a059471541346098.mp3"}},{"text":"그려보니까","meaning":"画；试，试图","explanation":"그리다：画；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그려보니까","audio":"/audio/9e85a29adc56cc67f409.mp3"}},{"text":"기능의","meaning":"功能，机能","explanation":"기능：功能，机能；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"기능","audio":"/audio/0e09e85c99c11646eebb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32491","senseId":"1","lemma":"기능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기능의","audio":"/audio/410b5a75b8c2a74ee6ea.mp3"}},{"text":"추가","meaning":"追加","explanation":"추가：追加。","readings":[{"term":"추가","audio":"/audio/b73accca8a4a51d3d53f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27781","senseId":"1","lemma":"추가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추가","audio":"/audio/b73accca8a4a51d3d53f.mp3"}},{"text":"여부에","meaning":"与否，是否","explanation":"여부：与否，是否；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여부","audio":"/audio/c97ad4a215b510923f6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67716","senseId":"1","lemma":"여부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여부에","audio":"/audio/c07c283dfa5656f39dde.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"按照","explanation":"따르다：按照；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"8","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"만족도가","meaning":"满意度","explanation":"만족도：满意度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"만족도","audio":"/audio/1a0f2d1a9b43bf70113a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52984","senseId":"1","lemma":"만족도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만족도가","audio":"/audio/81f1afa84f845e63724f.mp3"}},{"text":"완만하게","meaning":"缓","explanation":"완만하다：缓；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"완만하다","audio":"/audio/4f80bfe0a141b1c84259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68472","senseId":"2","lemma":"완만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완만하게","audio":"/audio/7cc8b7fecfcd3bb543b8.mp3"}},{"text":"곡선을","meaning":"曲线","explanation":"곡선：曲线；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"곡선","audio":"/audio/610020c4dc63880f784f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27576","senseId":"1","lemma":"곡선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곡선을","audio":"/audio/919ac8fb484f4ced4af3.mp3"}},{"text":"그리면서","meaning":"形成，组成","explanation":"그리다：形成，组成；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"3","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그리면서","audio":"/audio/059ee2fd27eb98fb0f96.mp3"}},{"text":"증가하더라고요.","meaning":"增加","explanation":"증가하다：增加；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"증가하다","audio":"/audio/98b8140ff15dd0e97289.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27744","senseId":"1","lemma":"증가하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"증가하더라고요","audio":"/audio/b31265bf075f3af0f128.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4694ee91180b2a45","term":"그래프","zh":"图表，图解，示意图","audio":"/audio/4694ee91180b2a45eb37.mp3","entryId":"36266","definition":"将数量或数值的变化用直线、曲线、虚线、柱形等加以表现的图画。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画；形成，组成","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"0e09e85c99c11646","term":"기능","zh":"功能，机能","audio":"/audio/0e09e85c99c11646eebb.mp3","entryId":"32491","definition":"起到某种角色或作用；或指那种角色或作用。","pronunciation":["기능"]},{"id":"b73accca8a4a51d3","term":"추가","zh":"追加","audio":"/audio/b73accca8a4a51d3d53f.mp3","entryId":"27781","definition":"后来再增加。","pronunciation":["추가"]},{"id":"c97ad4a215b51092","term":"여부","zh":"与否，是否","audio":"/audio/c97ad4a215b510923f6a.mp3","entryId":"67716","definition":"这样或不这样。","pronunciation":["여ː부"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"按照","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"根据某种条件、基准或状况。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"1a0f2d1a9b43bf70","term":"만족도","zh":"满意度","audio":"/audio/1a0f2d1a9b43bf70113a.mp3","entryId":"52984","definition":"某种期待或需要得到实现的感受程度。","pronunciation":["만족또"]},{"id":"4f80bfe0a141b1c8","term":"완만하다","zh":"缓","audio":"/audio/4f80bfe0a141b1c84259.mp3","entryId":"68472","definition":"倾斜的状态或程度不陡。","pronunciation":["완ː만하다"]},{"id":"610020c4dc63880f","term":"곡선","zh":"曲线","audio":"/audio/610020c4dc63880f784f.mp3","entryId":"27576","definition":"弯曲不笔直的线条。","pronunciation":["곡썬"]},{"id":"98b8140ff15dd0e9","term":"증가하다","zh":"增加","audio":"/audio/98b8140ff15dd0e97289.mp3","entryId":"27744","definition":"数或量增多。","pronunciation":["증가하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce477052636da990971a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.339,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68472","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":178,"sequenceScore":6.1657,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊先生，产品满意度调查的结果都整理好了吗？","是的，用图表展示后可以发现，根据是否添加新功能，满意度会呈平缓的曲线逐渐上升。","这座宫殿不愧是历代国王居住的宫殿，极为宏伟且奢华。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊先生，产品满意度调查的结果都整理好了吗？","是的，用图表展示后可以发现，根据是否添加新功能，满意度会呈平缓的曲线逐渐上升。","这座宫殿不愧是历代国王居住的宫殿，极为宏伟且奢华。"],"answer":1}]}
